  "title": "Kulaç Soda Bread",
  "slug": "kulac-soda-bread",
  "summary": "Kulaç is an Albanian soda bread made with Greek yogurt, resulting in a dense, slightly tangy texture. It is often shaped into a circle and can be decorated with fork patterns before baking.",
